data: {"answer": "This room is the Breakwater · Network Perimeter. It contains a firewall and an Intrusion Detection & Prevention (IDS/IPS) system. You can see network segmentation controls here as well. This area demonstrates that defense in depth requires more than just a firewall alone.", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "What does the Firewall do?", "en": "What does the Firewall do?", "zh": "防火牆是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 6.71, "total_s": 6.73}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "breakwater", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "breakwater"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 6.6}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "breakwater", "label": "Room", "en": "Breakwater", "zh": "防波堤"}, {"key": "firewall", "label": "System", "en": "Firewall", "zh": "防火牆"}, {"key": "ids", "label": "System", "en": "Intrusion Detection & Prevention (IDS/IPS)", "zh": "入侵偵測與防禦（IDS/IPS）"}, {"key": "segmentation", "label": "Control", "en": "Network Segmentation", "zh": "網段隔離"}, {"key": "firewall_ids", "label": "Control", "en": "Firewall & Intrusion Detection", "zh": "防火牆與入侵偵測"}, {"key": "c_defense_in_depth", "label": "Concept", "en": "Defense in Depth", "zh": "縱深防禦"}], "edges": [{"a": "firewall", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "breakwater"}, {"a": "ids", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "breakwater"}, {"a": "c_defense_in_depth", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "breakwater"}, {"a": "c_defense_in_depth", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "firewall_ids"}, {"a": "c_defense_in_depth", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "segmentation"}, {"a": "segmentation", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "breakwater"}, {"a": "firewall_ids", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "breakwater"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Breakwater · Network Perimeter\nWhat it shows: The breakwater keeps the waves out like a firewall; the small light warns of intrusions like an IDS.\nKey lesson: Defence in depth: a firewall alone is not enough.\nSystems here: Firewall, Intrusion Detection & Prevention (IDS/IPS)\nControls you can see: Network Segmentation, Firewall & Intrusion Detection\nConcepts: Defense in Depth\nExits: Steamer Deck · Working on the Move, Harbour Square · Suppliers", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 6.71, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 548, "prompt_s": 2.22, "gen_tokens": 55, "gen_s": 4.47, "tok_per_s": 12.3, "first_token_s": 2.24}}, "state": {}}

